{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>法國示威｜法國因生活成本高漲而引發全國大規模示威，並演變成暴力騷亂，大量商店被趁機洗劫(路透社)</figcaption></figure><p>法國上周六（17日）起因生活成本高漲而引發全國大規模示威，並演變成暴力騷亂，大量商店被趁機洗劫。鑑於法國的最新示威活動情況，特區政府今日（20日）對法國發出黃色外遊警示。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.649711+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:45:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:59.165759+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:58.367077+00:00","content_hash":"56830264396d58c47cba27638820758bdb75c6cb02fb7c2e0b28263f8cc229f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}